{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_totter_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_totter_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"计划","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_totter_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"1334ab7c4a25a5433c0ca99df206459412ec4cea0c243742eb56dbe4ac4db1dd","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"开门，你个骗钱的杂种！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"给老子开门！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别装睡，给老子爬起来开门！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你啊， 哈伦先生。你敲门的动静太大了，会吵到周围人的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（揪住铅踝的领子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"混账，我的钱很好拿是吗？我本人很好糊弄是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你当时怎么说的？周五就会给我结果！现在周五了，你他妈连离开的行李都打包好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈伦先生，你耐心点，之后我会向你解释的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（扯开哈伦的手）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"解释？我不要解释，我要结果，明白吗？我现在就要看到你带着那群畜生的脑袋来找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看表）稍等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你说给你五天就够，我给你了，结果呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认为现在计划进展得非常顺利，马上就会有结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"计划？你前面四天都在做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"周一喝咖啡，周二打扑克，周三逛市集，周四睡大觉，现在就要到周五了，你还在屋里连屁股都不打算挪一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看表）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你他妈能不能别看你那破表了！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还不到时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么，你的意思是我太着急了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"妈的你个混账当然不着急，因为被那群荒地劫匪夺走一切的人是我而不是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我知道，从你给的薪金可以看出来，你的积蓄所剩无几。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的，但凡我还剩一点钱，你现在要操心的就不是别人的脑袋了，而是你自己的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然这么说，我以为我们的雇佣关系还算良好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（颓然靠墙）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我就该跟着老婆一起在那场劫难中死去......也好过在你这里受气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你想喝热水吗？我可以为你倒一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你——算了，我为什么要和你说这些......你对我的感受一无所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不是......多多少少能有些......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那算我求你，做点什么吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看表）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间到了，你要一起来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按你的要求，血债血偿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是这里了，你有把骑来的驮兽藏好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"藏好了......不对，我花钱雇佣了你，为什么你却在指挥我干活？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不好意思，哈伦先生，那要不我再去把它捆一遍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我看不必了，你不如先向我解释你拉我来这破地方到底要干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"望远镜？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，看那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我什么也没有看到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再往更远处看，从地平线缓缓朝这里驶来的一列车队，血红色的旗帜，黑色的骷髅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"是他们，我看到了，就是他们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拉开弓弦）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你不要望远镜吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，这么远，你能瞄准吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘘——安静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，任务完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"这么快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？你难道还想看别的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"还有别的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"亵渎尸体不太好吧？如果你非常想的话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你......已经确定了他们没有人存活吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看爆炸波及的范围，嗯，应该希望不大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"都死了，死得好，死得好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的语气听起来很唏嘘，我以为仇人死了你会开心起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我也以为自己会开心，但是......发生得太快了，感觉很不真实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然这个时候提不太好，但是那个另一半......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（丢出一袋金币）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去，你都拿去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（捡起钱袋）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有什么要说的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢惠顾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"那群废物派人找了整整一个月都摸不着他们的踪迹，你是怎么办到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道他们会在这个时间，这个地点出现？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，别在这里说，换个地方吧，我得好好喝一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在的状态不适合饮酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你又怎么知道呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，这个镇子的人会在清晨饮酒，就是为了庆祝太阳升起。我点了两杯，你要哪一杯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这两杯的大小看起来有些悬殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，因为大杯是我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那为什么要我选？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"因为客套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我选小杯，谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（举起杯子一口气喝掉半杯）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——嗝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"现在可以给我讲讲吗？你是怎么做到的？你前几天什么都没有准备，只是时间到了，出现在那里，然后拉开弓，咻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"他们就全没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"你会预知？还是你买通了他们中的一个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"来来，快点告诉我吧，我实在想不通。昨天晚上找到你时我还觉得你这家伙一定是在骗我，现在我对你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"啧——简直五体投地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有些亢奋了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我喝酒了嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做到这些并不难，有一个完备的计划，一步一步跟着来，结果总是大差不差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掏出自己的笔记本）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你曾抱怨周一我在这里的咖啡馆待了一整天无所事事，但咖啡馆在镇子里有很特殊的作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对于往来的商旅，它更像......信息集散中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的消息都是从那里散布出去的，无论是可靠的消息，还是、咳、假消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡椒商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你手里的香料运出去了吗？我试过换另外的线路，但是几乎每次都会遇到埋伏，那些家伙对我们的行踪可以说是了如指掌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乳香商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还在想办法。不然请雇佣兵来护送商队？总比积压在仓库里好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胡椒商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉......王酋军迟迟不来清剿，不知这样的日子何时能结束。我账上的数字已经难以负担更多的支出了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好，请问要什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一杯咖啡，谢谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里的咖啡味道浓厚，或许您会觉得苦涩难咽，这碟蜜渍椰枣送给您，喝完可以吃一个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你，我不怕苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小姐，可以问下这镇子里的医生住在哪里吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"咖啡店员","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，东面，顺着喷泉一路向东走就能看到的。您生病了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一批急救药品，或许有人会想要。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在荒地上，万能的货币是药品而不是金钱，消息我已经放出去了，接下来，我需要证明，我值得他们专门为我来一趟。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"居然都到这个点了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"首饰商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"朋友，你今天可输得有点惨，看这大把的金币，你太太看到一定不会轻易罢休。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是些小钱而已，怡情所用，无伤大雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"木材商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，我们就是喜欢你这样阔气的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你们还要再来一局吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"周三一早，果不其然，我居所的窗下出现了陌生的脚印，虽然有被掩盖，但手法并不专业。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈伦先生，你打过猎吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"动物有自己的领地，在领地内觅食、嬉戏、巡视都有自己的规律。摸准它们的习惯，放置陷阱便成了一件轻松的事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_srgmarket"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你这么快就打算要离开了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，此地盛传的关于荒地劫匪的事让我无法安心，能尽快抽身离开最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我想向诸位咨询，你们知道还有什么其他的路可以从这里离开吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小贩A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"实话和你说，先生，走哪条路都没有用，你根本无法躲开他们的突袭，他们准确掌握着你的所有动向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们都有被袭击的经历吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"上次我的商队从镇子东边的小路出发，想着那群畜生不会注意，但离开不到一小时，就遇到了他们的埋伏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是太可怕了，你们中间就没有人侥幸逃过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这一个月我们试过无数的道路，无论是偏僻的小径，还是堂皇的大道，只要一踏上路面，就必定会遭遇这些不幸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"通过对比这些商队的路线和他们遇到劫匪的地点，我大致确定了这些不法之徒的行动范围。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"并找到了几个合适的狙击点，确保我的弓弩射程能够完全覆盖这些地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最后我要做的便是驱赶猎物进入陷阱了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，小子，要不要赚一笔外快？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"机灵的男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，请问您有什么吩咐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我明天就要出远门了，为我准备好十天的淡水和干粮，驮兽要在夜晚来临前喂足粮草，天不亮我就得出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，对了，这是你的报酬，四个金币，明天五点我会在镇子的西口等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"机灵的男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哇，您真是太慷慨了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从现在开始不要打扰我，我得在出行前补足睡眠，不要傻站着了，快去办事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"机灵的男孩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好好，没问题，我做事包您满意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其实，做这些事情只需要两个金币，但我多给了一倍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个年纪的孩子，多赚一笔难免四处炫耀。他告诉的人越多，我的目标就越容易达成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你昨天并没有在睡觉吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我确实睡了很长时间，第二天用眼睛，我得保持充足的精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（喝了一口酒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......就是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来你好像很失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我以为我能听到的，是一个传奇雇佣兵的惊世传说，但是听下来感觉更像我老婆拿给我的商业计划书，很详细，却也很乏味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的计划不应该有太多的起伏，越稳妥越好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"她也这么说！她甚至和你一样，随身带着一个笔记本来记她的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得这个习惯很不错，人相信什么都不能相信自己的破记性。那她现在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"被劫匪一刀砍掉了脑袋......我记得刚找上你的时候就告诉你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，至少现在她不用再为做计划书而烦恼了。要不是我当初强拉她掺和进自己的生意，她现在应该会做个诗人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，诗人是个不错的职业，挺安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我说实话会冒犯你吗？和你聊天让我感觉不太舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，很多人都这么说，我很感激那些只是嘴上说说的人，有更多的人他们会直接动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"理智告诉我，我应该说点什么安慰你，但是很遗憾，我的情感不容许。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）唉，算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"我能看看你的笔记本吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好的，请。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，这么大的字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的眼睛有点小毛病，近处的事物反而没有远处的看得清晰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎，你很仔细地规划了生活里的每一件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，有个框架，遇到麻烦了就不会手忙脚乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（合上本子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，你这样的人，一定将一切都牢牢攥在手心里，一点差错也不会有，一丝偏移都不会有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"想必你的人生肯定是在你的掌控下一帆风顺，不会突然有一天就陷入一无所有的境地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（灌了一大口酒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不安地摩挲着杯把）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"不是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，我的人生里从来就没几件事能在我的掌控之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轻抿一口酒）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"可怜的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请别这么说我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我在说我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿起杯子一饮而尽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"结账吧，我得走了。嘶，我身上的钱呢......啊，我都忘了，已经全部支付给你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我来结吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不这些金币你拿走吧，以后身无分文怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_164","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那些你留着吧，我应该用不到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喝醉了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不用管我，我能自己站起来。拜拜了，朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪白昼消逝前，我伸臂揽她入怀♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪她浅紫色的面纱下，茉莉香气暗暗氤氲♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪那片柔软的双唇将带我离开♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪去往永恒的故园♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"落魄商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"♪那一刻的阵痛，终结我的一生♪"},{"type":"narration","text":"酒醉的商人迎着从地平线升起的朝阳，拖着蹒跚的步伐渐渐步入那片火红色的巨轮，他的背影义无反顾，就像投入恋人炙热的怀抱。\n沙漠里干燥的风将他的歌声温柔地裹上细沙，妥善保存，然后送至下一个旅人的喉间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪路易萨，我心里的路易萨♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪带我归家，有你相伴，我别无所求♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪路易萨，我梦里的路易萨♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_snow_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虽然很难说出口，但是托特尔，我们只能将你安置在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们的队伍将继续北上，因为脚伤，你无法跟上我们的速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要把我丢在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里靠近雪境，雪景很美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算把我丢在这里，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会给你留下一笔钱，离这不远有个村庄，你可以换些生活必需的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你他妈别再绕圈子了！回答我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"托特尔，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安，告诉我，你也是这么想的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别这样，你也清楚不是吗？队伍不可能为了你放慢脚步，我们都有任务需要完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你们都要丢下我，是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你已经不是孩子了，闹脾气最不是个办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是我们当初约定好的，安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"谁都料不到未来的事......托特尔。来年春天，或许我们会返回，或许那时情况又会不一样，别太丧气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那你们会来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷静的女声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"低沉的男声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪路易萨，我心里的路易萨♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪带我归家，有你相伴，我别无所求♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪路易萨，我梦里的路易萨♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪我将永远等候你......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"♪......的到来♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（拿起杯子一饮而尽）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"钥匙，钥匙在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这把吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，开不了，不是这把。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这把？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是......不开了，就这样吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（席地坐下）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......几点了，约定好的时间应该快到了，就在门外等着好了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"屋檐在高温的沙地上投下一片阴影，隔绝了炎热的空气与酷辣的阳光，将铅踝蜷起的身体纳入阴影。\n在一阵和风中，铅踝的眼皮再也支撑不住，紧紧地合上了。\n背靠着门框，他在一片酣梦中安睡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"铅踝先生，铅踝先生，醒醒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......啊！怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我是来接你的干员，对不起，来的路上飞行器遭遇了沙暴，所以延误了，你没有等很久吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（站起来拍拍裤子上的土）没有没有，你来得正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"可我看你都睡着了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是小睡一阵，刚刚才出门，没有睡很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你......为什么在笑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我笑了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸摸自己的嘴角）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铅踝","speakerId":"avg_4062_totter_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真奇怪，我为什么笑了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
